  { topic:"Agricultural Geography", q:"Which of the following are types of coffee? (A) Liberica (B) Arabica (C) Robusta (D) Darjeeling (E) Oolong", opts:["C, D & E Only","B, C & D Only","A, B & C Only","A, C & E Only"], ans:2 },
